  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I’m pleased that the addition of the \"Audio from Camera\" option now allows audio to be received from sources other than the player’s position.\n\nHowever, this introduces inconsistencies in cases where Doppler effect calculations rely on the relative velocity between the player and a vehicle.\n\nWhile it is currently possible to infer the position of the AudioListener by checking whether a drone is deployed or whether it is in FPV mode, implementing such logic on the Udon gimmick side is not intuitive.\n\nI would like to request the addition of an API that allows direct access to the AudioListener’s position.",
